# The wrench swung for real (Rerac-vr's embodied.rs): the grip takes it out, fast strokes across the
# body hit what the head sweeps; slow ones do not. [sim] hittable lines list what is near at the
# start; [vr-wrench] lines give each hit with its speeds.
600 y 1
606 y 0
3200 shot ahead
3250 right_grip 1
3250 rh_y -0.25
3300 shot wrench
# Slow strokes, side to side: no hits.
3320 rh_x -0.10
3340 rh_x 0.10
3360 rh_x -0.10
3380 rh_x 0
# Fast strokes: 40 cm in about 50 ms, across and back, five times.
3395 shot before
3400 rh_x -0.20
3401 rh_x -0.10
3402 rh_x 0.00
# Mid-stroke: the wrench drawn longer as its hits reach (up to 35%), the grip still in the hand.
3402 shot stroke
3403 rh_x 0.10
3404 rh_x 0.20
3415 shot after
3430 rh_x 0.10
3431 rh_x 0.00
3432 rh_x -0.10
3433 rh_x -0.20
3460 rh_x -0.10
3461 rh_x 0.00
3462 rh_x 0.10
3463 rh_x 0.20
3490 rh_x 0.10
3491 rh_x 0.00
3492 rh_x -0.10
3493 rh_x -0.20
3520 rh_x -0.10
3521 rh_x 0.00
3522 rh_x 0.10
3523 rh_x 0.20
3530 shot swung
3600 rh_x 0
